      "source": "Returns the appropriate <a href=\"../../conversion/IdValueSource.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\"><code>IdValueSource</code></a> for the instance: <a href=\"../../conversion/IdValueSource.html#NONE\"><code>IdValueSource.NONE</code></a> when the entity has no\nid property, <a href=\"../../conversion/IdValueSource.html#PROVIDED\"><code>IdValueSource.PROVIDED</code></a> when the value of the id property is not null and when it is a\nprimitive type, not zero, and <a href=\"../../conversion/IdValueSource.html#GENERATED\"><code>IdValueSource.GENERATED</code></a> otherwise.",
